#: background.cpp:49
msgid "E&nable background"
msgstr "Uključi po&zadinu"

#: background.cpp:51
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will use the settings below for the background. If "
"it is disabled, you have to look after the background yourself. This is done "
"by running some program (possibly xsetroot) in the script specified in the "
"Setup= option in kdmrc (usually Xsetup)."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo odabrano, KDM će koristiti postavke date ispod za pozadinu. Ako "
"je isključeno, moraćete se sami pobrinuti za pozadinu. Ovo se radi "
"koristeći neki program (moguće xsetroot) u skripti navedenoj u opciji "
"Setup= u kdmrc-u (najčešće Xsetup)."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:71
msgid "&Greeting:"
msgstr "&Pozdrav:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:76
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is the string KDM will display in the login window. You may want to put "
"here some nice greeting or information about the operating system."
"<p> KDM will replace the string '%n' with the actual host name of the "
"computer running the X server. Especially in networks this is a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je tekst koji će KDM prikazati u login prozoru. Možda ćete željeti "
"da stavite ovdje neki zanimljiv pozdrav ili informaciju o operativnom "
"sistemu."
"<p> KDM će zamijeniti tekst '%n' sa stvarnim nazivom računara "
"(hostname-om) na kojem se nalazi X server. Ovo je dobra ideja, posebno u "
"mrežama."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:90
msgid "Logo area:"
msgstr "Područje za logo:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:95 kdm-conv.cpp:78 kdm-users.cpp:108
msgid "&None"
msgstr "&Nikoga"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:96
msgid "Show cloc&k"
msgstr "Prikaži &sat"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:97
msgid "Sho&w logo"
msgstr "Pri&kaži logo:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:109
msgid ""
"You can choose to display a custom logo (see below), a clock or no logo at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati da se prikaže vlastiti logo (vidi niže), sat ili nikakav "
"logo."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:115
msgid "&Logo:"
msgstr "&Logo:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Click here to choose an image that KDM will display. You can also drag and "
"drop an image onto this button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Klikinite ovdje za izbor slike koju će KDM prikazivati. Također možete "
"vući i ispustiti sliku na ovo dugme (npr. iz Konquerora)."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:140
msgid "Position:"
msgstr "Pozicija:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:145
msgid "Cente&red"
msgstr "&Centrirano"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:146
msgid "Spec&ify"
msgstr "&Navedi"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:156
msgid ""
"You can choose whether the login dialog should be centered or placed at "
"specified coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati da li će dijalog za prijavu biti centriran ili smješten "
"na odabranim koordinatama."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:165
msgid "&X:"
msgstr "&X:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:172
msgid "&Y:"
msgstr "&Y:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:179
msgid "Here you specify the coordinates of the login dialog's <em>center</em>."
msgstr "Ovdje možete zadati koordinate <em>središta</em> login dijaloga."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:198
msgid "GUI s&tyle:"
msgstr "&Stil GUIja:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:202
msgid "You can choose a basic GUI style here that will be used by KDM only."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati osnovni stil GUIja koji će biti korišten samo u "
"KDMu."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:209
msgid "&Color scheme:"
msgstr "&Šema boja:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:213
msgid "You can choose a basic Color Scheme here that will be used by KDM only."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati osnovnu šemu boja koja će biti korištena samo u "
"KDMu."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:218
msgid "Echo &mode:"
msgstr "&Echo mod:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:221
msgid "No Echo"
msgstr "Bez eho-a"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:222
msgid "One Star"
msgstr "Jedna zvijezda"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:223
msgid "Three Stars"
msgstr "Tri zvijezde"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:227
msgid "You can choose whether and how KDM shows your password when you type it."
msgstr "Možete izabrati da li će i kako KDM prikazati vašu šifru dok je kucate."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:233
msgid "Locale"
msgstr "Lokalno"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:240
msgid "Languag&e:"
msgstr "&Jezik:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:247
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the language used by KDM. This setting doesn't affect a "
"user's personal settings that will take effect after login."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati jezik koji će KDM upotrebljavati. Postavka jezika "
"ovdje se neće odraziti na korisnikove lične postavke koje stupaju na snagu "
"nakon prijave."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:293
msgid "without name"
msgstr "bez imena"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:412
msgid ""
"There was an error loading the image:\n"
"%1\n"
"It will not be saved."
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do greške prilikom učitavanja slike:\n"
"%1\n"
"Ona neće biti spašena."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:456 kdm-appear.cpp:506
#, c-format
msgid "Welcome to %s at %n"
msgstr "Dobro došli u %s na %n"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:525
msgid ""
"<h1>KDM - Appearance</h1>"
" Here you can configure the basic appearance of the KDM login manager, i.e. "
"a greeting string, an icon etc."
"<p> For further refinement of KDM's appearance, see the \"Font\" and "
"\"Background\"  tabs."
msgstr ""
"<h1>KDM - Izgled</h1>  Ovdje možete postaviti osnovni izgled KDM login "
"menadžera, tj. pozdravni tekst, ikonu itd."
"<p> Za daljnje rafiniranje KDMovog izgleda, pogledajte kartice \"Font\" i "
"\"Pozadina\"."

#: kdm-font.cpp:44
msgid "Select Fonts"
msgstr "Izaberi fontove"

#: kdm-font.cpp:47
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "Pozdrav"

#: kdm-font.cpp:48
msgid "Fail"
msgstr "Greška"

#: kdm-font.cpp:49
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standardni"

#: kdm-font.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Here you can select the font you want to change. KDM knows three fonts: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Greeting:</em> used to display KDM's greeting string (see "
"\"Appearance\" tab)</li>"
"<li><em>Fail:</em> used to display a message when a person fails to "
"login</li><li><em>Standard:</em> used for the rest of the text</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati font koji želite promijeniti. KDM poznaje tri "
"fonta:"
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Pozdrav:</em> koristi se za prikazivanje KDMovog pozdravnog teksta "
"(vidi stranu \"Izgled\")</li>"
"<li><em>Greška:</em> koristi se za prikazivanje poruke kada korisnik ne "
"uspjeva da se logira</li>"
"<li><em>Standardni:</em> koristi se za ostali tekst</li></ul>"

#: kdm-font.cpp:58
msgid "C&hange Font..."
msgstr "Pro&mijeni font..."

#: kdm-font.cpp:62
msgid "Click here to change the selected font."
msgstr "Kliknite ovdje za promjenu izabranog fonta."

#: kdm-font.cpp:66
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Primjer"

#: kdm-font.cpp:67
msgid "Shows a preview of the selected font."
msgstr "Prikazuje primjer izabranog fonta."

#: kdm-font.cpp:74
msgid "Use anti-aliasing for fonts"
msgstr "Koristi anti-aliasing za fontove"

#: kdm-font.cpp:75
msgid ""
"If you check this box and your X-Server has the Xft extension, fonts will be "
"antialiased (smoothed) in the login dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciji, a vaš X-Server ima Xft ekstenziju, fontovi u "
"login dijalogu će biti antialiasirani (zaobljeni)"

#: kdm-font.cpp:176
msgid "Greeting font"
msgstr "Pozdravni font"

#: kdm-font.cpp:180
msgid "Fail font"
msgstr "Font greške"

#: kdm-font.cpp:184
msgid "Standard font"
msgstr "Standardni font"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:48
msgid "Allow Shutdown"
msgstr "Dozvoli gašenje"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:51
msgid "Co&nsole:"
msgstr "Samo &konzola"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:52 kdm-sess.cpp:58
msgid "Everybody"
msgstr "Svi"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:53 kdm-sess.cpp:59
msgid "Only root"
msgstr "Samo root"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:54 kdm-sess.cpp:60
msgid "Nobody"
msgstr "Niko"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:57
msgid "Re&mote:"
msgstr "U&daljeni"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:62
msgid ""
"Here you can select who is allowed to shutdown the computer using KDM. You "
"can specify different values for local (console) and remote displays. "
"Possible values are:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Everybody:</em> everybody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li> "
"<li><em>Only root:</em> KDM will only allow shutdown after the user has "
"entered the root password</li> "
"<li><em>Nobody:</em> nobody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati kome je dozvoljeno da izvrši gašenje računara "
"koristeći KDM. Možete navesti različite vrijednosti za lokalni pristup "
"(konzola) i udaljene ekrane. Moguće vrijednosti su:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Svi:</em> svako može ugasiti računar pomoću KDMa</li> "
"<li><em>Niko:</em> niko ne može ugasiti računar koristeći KDM</li> "
"<li><em>Samo Root:</em> KDM će dozvoliti gašenje računara tek nakon što "
"korisnik unese root šifru</li> "
"<li><em>Samo konzola:</em> samo korisnik koji se nalazi ispred ovog "
"računara ga može ugasiti pomoću KDMa</li></ul>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:70
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Naredbe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:73
msgid "Ha&lt:"
msgstr "Ha&lt:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:76
msgid "Command to initiate the system halt. Typical value: /sbin/halt"
msgstr "Naredba koja inicira gašenje sistema. Uobičajena vrijednost: /sbin/halt"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:81
msgid "&Reboot:"
msgstr "&Reboot:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:84
msgid "Command to initiate the system reboot. Typical value: /sbin/reboot"
msgstr ""
"Naredba koja inicira restartovanje sistema. Uobičajena vrijednost: "
"/sbin/reboot"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:89
msgid "LILO"
msgstr "LILO"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:91
msgid "Show boot opt&ions"
msgstr "Prikaži opc&ije boota"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:96
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable LILO boot options in the \"Shutdown...\" dialog."
msgstr "Omogućuje prikazivanje Lilo boot opcija u dijalogu \"Gašenje...\"."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:100
msgid "LILO command:"
msgstr "LILO naredba:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:103
#, fuzzy
msgid "Command to run LILO. Typical value: /sbin/lilo"
msgstr "Naredba za pokretanje Lilo-a. Uobičajena vrijednost: /sbin/lilo"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:108
msgid "LILO map file:"
msgstr "LILO map datoteka:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:111
msgid "Position of Lilo's map file. Typical value: /boot/map"
msgstr "Pozicija map datoteke Lilo-a. Uobičajena vrijednost: /boot/map"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:116
msgid "Session Types"
msgstr "Tipovi sesija"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:119
msgid "New t&ype:"
msgstr "&Novi tip:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:126
msgid ""
"To create a new session type, enter its name here and click on <em>Add "
"new</em>"
msgstr ""
"Da biste napravili novi tip sesije, unesite njegov naziv ovdje i kliknite na "
"<em>Dodaj</em>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:130
msgid "Add Ne&w"
msgstr "&Dodaj"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:134
msgid ""
"Click here to add the new session type entered in the <em>New type</em> "
"field to the list of available sessions."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovdje za dodavanje novog tipa sesije koja je unesena u polje "
"<em>Novi tip</em> na listu dostupnih sesija."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:137
msgid "Available &types:"
msgstr "Dostupni &tipovi:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:140
msgid ""
"This box lists the available session types that will be presented to the "
"user. Names other than \"default\" and \"failsafe\" are usually treated as "
"program names, but it depends on your Xsession script what the session type "
"means."
msgstr ""
"Ovo polje izlistava sve dostupne tipove sesija koji će biti predstavljeni "
"korisniku. Imena osim \"default\" i \"failsafe\" se obično tretiraju kao "
"nazivi programa, ali šta tip sesije znači ovisi o vašoj Xsession skripti."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:146
msgid "R&emove"
msgstr "U&kloni"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:150
msgid "Click here to remove the currently selected session type"
msgstr "Kliknite ovdje za uklanjanje trenutno izabranog tipa sesije"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:162
msgid ""
"With these two arrow buttons, you can change the order in which the "
"available session types are presented to the user"
msgstr ""
"Pomoću ova dva dugmeta sa strelicama, možete izmijeniti redoslijed u kojem "
"će dostupni tipovi sesija biti predstavljeni korisniku"

#: kdm-users.cpp:71 kdm-users.cpp:77
#, c-format
msgid "Couldn't create directory %1"
msgstr "Ne mogu napraviti direktorij %1"

#: kdm-users.cpp:80
msgid "<default>"
msgstr "<uobičajeno>"

#: kdm-users.cpp:84
msgid "System U&IDs"
msgstr "Sistemski U&IDovi"

#: kdm-users.cpp:85
msgid ""
"Users with a UID (numerical user identification) outside this range will not "
"be listed by KDM and this setup dialog. Note that users with the UID 0 "
"(typically root) are not affected by this and must be explicitly hidden in "
"\"Not hidden\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Korisnici sa UIDom (numerička identifikacija korisnika) izvan ovog raspona "
"neće biti izlistani u KDMu ni ovom dijalogu. Primjetite da korisnik sa "
"UIDom 0 (tipično root) neće biti pogođen ovim i mora biti eksplicitno "
"sakriven u načinu \"Nisu sakriveni\"."

#: kdm-users.cpp:90
msgid "Below:"
msgstr "Ispod:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:97
msgid "Above:"
msgstr "Preko:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:105
msgid "Show Users"
msgstr "Prikaži korisnike"

#: kdm-users.cpp:109
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will not show any users. If one of the "
"alternative radio buttons is selected, KDM will show a list of users, so "
"users can click on their name or image rather than typing in their login."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija izabrana, KDM neće prikazati nijednog korisnika. Ako je "
"neko drugo radio dugme odabrano, KDM će prikazati listu korisnika, tako da "
"korisnici mogu odabrati svoje ime i sliku umjesto da kucaju svoj login."

#: kdm-users.cpp:112
msgid ""
"_: selected users\n"
"Selected onl&y"
msgstr "Samo &izabrani"

#: kdm-users.cpp:113
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will only show the users checked in the "
"\"Select users\" list."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija izabrana, KDM će prikazati samo korisnike navedene u "
"listi \"Izabrani korisnici\"."

#: kdm-users.cpp:115
msgid ""
"_: not hidden users\n"
"Not hidden"
msgstr "Nisu sakriveni"

#: kdm-users.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will show all non-system users, except those "
"checked in the \"Select users\" list."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija izabrana, KDM će prikazati samo ne-sistemske korisnike, "
"osim onih navedenih u listi \"Izabrani korisnici\"."

#: kdm-users.cpp:118
msgid "Sor&t users"
msgstr "Sor&tiraj korisnike"

#: kdm-users.cpp:120
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will alphabetically sort the user list. Otherwise "
"users are listed in the order they appear in the password file."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija izabrana, KDM će abecedno sortirati listu korisnika. U "
"suprotnom, korisnici su izlistani redom kojim su navedeni u password "
"datoteci."

#: kdm-users.cpp:124
msgid "S&elect users:"
msgstr "&Izabrani korisnici:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:126
msgid "Selected Users"
msgstr "Izabrani korisnici"

#: kdm-users.cpp:128
msgid "KDM will show all checked users."
msgstr "KDM će prikazati sve odabrane korisnike."

#: kdm-users.cpp:135
msgid "Hidden Users"
msgstr "Skriveni korisnici"

#: kdm-users.cpp:137
msgid "KDM will show all non-checked non-system users."
msgstr "KDM će prikazati sve ne-izabrane ne-sistemske korisnike."

#: kdm-users.cpp:144
msgid "User Image Source"
msgstr "Izvor za slike korisnika"

#: kdm-users.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Here you can specify where KDM will obtain the images that represent users. "
"\"Admin\" represents the global directory; these are the pictures you can "
"set below. \"User\" means that KDM should read the user's $HOME/.face.icon "
"file. The two selections in the middle define the order of preference if "
"both sources are available."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odrediti gdje će KDM tražiti slike koje predstavljaju "
"korisnike. \"Admin\" predstavlja globalni direktorij, ovo su slike koje "
"možete podesiti ispod. \"Korisnik\" znači da KDM treba čitati korisnikovu "
"$HOME/.face.icon datoteku. Dva izbora u sredini definišu red preference ako "
"su oba izvora dostupna."

#: kdm-users.cpp:151
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "Admin"

#: kdm-users.cpp:152
msgid "Admin, user"
msgstr "Admin, korisnik"

#: kdm-users.cpp:153
msgid "User, admin"
msgstr "Korisnik, admin"

#: kdm-users.cpp:154
msgid "User"
msgstr "Korisnik"

#: kdm-users.cpp:156
msgid "User Images"
msgstr "Korisničke slike"

#: kdm-users.cpp:159
msgid "The user the image below belongs to."
msgstr "Korisnik kojem pripada slika ispod."

#: kdm-users.cpp:162
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Korisnik:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:169
msgid "Click or drop an image here"
msgstr "Klikni ili ispusti sliku ovdje"

#: kdm-users.cpp:170
msgid ""
"Here you can see the image assigned to the user selected in the combo box "
"above. Click on the image button to select from a list of images or drag and "
"drop your own image on to the button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete vidjeti sliku pridruženu korisniku koji je izabran u combo "
"polju iznads. Kliknite na dugme slike kako biste izabrali neku od slika sa "
"liste ili prevucite vašu vlastitu sliku na dugme (npr. iz Konquerora)."

#: kdm-users.cpp:172
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "Poništi"

#: kdm-users.cpp:173
msgid "Click this button to make KDM use the default image for the selected user."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ovo dugme kako bi KDM koristio osnovnu sliku za izabranog "
"korisnika."

#: kdm-users.cpp:266
msgid "Save image as default image?"
msgstr "Spasi sliku kao osnovnu?"

#: kdm-users.cpp:274
#, c-format
msgid ""
"There was an error loading the image\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do greške prilikom učitavanja slike\n"
"%1"

#: kdm-users.cpp:282
#, c-format
msgid ""
"There was an error saving the image:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do greške prilikom snimanja slike:\n"
"%1"

#: kdm-users.cpp:294
msgid "Choose Image"
msgstr "Izaberite sliku"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:46
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<center><font color=red><big><b>Attention!"
"<br>Read help!</b></big></font></center></qt>"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:50
msgid "Automatic Login"
msgstr "Automatsko logiranje"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:53
msgid "Enable au&to-login"
msgstr "Omogući &auto-login"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Turn on the auto-login feature. This applies only to KDM's graphical login. "
"Think twice before enabling this!"
msgstr ""
"Uključuje auto-login opciju. Ovo se odnosi samo na KDMov grafički login. "
"Razmislite dvaput prije nego što uključite ovo!"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:62
msgid "Use&r:"
msgstr "&Korisnik:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:64
msgid "Select the user to be logged in automatically."
msgstr "Izaberite korisnika koji će automatski biti logiran."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:73
msgid "Preselect User"
msgstr "Izabrani korisnik"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:79
msgid "Prev&ious"
msgstr "Pret&hodni"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Preselect the user that logged in previously. Use this if this computer is "
"usually used several consecutive times by one user."
msgstr ""
"Pre-izaberi korisnika koji se zadnji prijavio. Koristite ovo ako ovaj "
"računar obično koristi isti korisnik nekoliko puta zaredom."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:82
msgid "Specif&y"
msgstr "Nave&di"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Preselect the user specified in the combo box below. Use this if this "
"computer is predominantly used by a certain user."
msgstr ""
"Pre-izaberi korisnika koji je naveden u combo polju ispod. Koristite ovo ako "
"ovaj računar uglavnom koristi samo jedan korisnik."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:87
msgid "Us&er:"
msgstr "K&orisnik:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:89
msgid ""
"Select the user to be preselected for login. This box is editable, so you "
"can specify an arbitrary non-existent user to mislead possible attackers."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite korisnika koje će biti pre-izabran za prijavu. Ovo polje se može "
"editovati, tako da možete unijeti nepostojećeg korisnika kako biste zaveli "
"eventualne napadače."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:98
msgid "Focus pass&word"
msgstr "Fokusiraj na &šifru"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:99
msgid ""
"When this option is on, KDM will place the cursor in the password field "
"instead of the user field after preselecting a user. Use this to save one "
"key press per login, if the preselection usually does not need to be changed."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija uključena, KDM će postaviti kursor na polje za unos "
"šifre umjesto polja za unos korisničkog imena nakon odabira korisnika. Ovo skraćuje "
"prijavu za jedan pritisak tipke ako se korisničko ime rijetko mijenja."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:105
#, fuzzy
msgid "Password-Less Login"
msgstr "Login bez šifre"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:107
msgid "Enable password-&less logins"
msgstr "Omogući &logine bez šifre"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:108
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the checked users from the list below will be "
"allowed to log in without entering their password. This applies only to "
"KDM's graphical login. Think twice before enabling this!"
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija uključena, korisnicima sa liste desno će biti "
"omogućeno da se logiraju bez unošenja šifre. Ovo se odnosi samo na KDMov "
"grafički login. Razmislite dvaput prije nego što omogućite ovo!"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:116
msgid "No password re&quired for:"
msgstr "Šifra nije pot&rebna za:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:122
msgid "Check all users you want to allow a password-less login for."
msgstr "Izaberite sve korisnike kojima želite dozvoliti prijavu bez šifre."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:126
msgid "Automatically log in again after &X server crash"
msgstr "Automatski se ponovo logiraj nakon pada &X servera"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:127
msgid ""
"When this option is on, a user will be logged in again automatically, when "
"his session is interrupted by an X server crash. Note, that this can open a "
"security hole: if you use another screen locker than KDE's integrated one, "
"this will make circumventing a password-secured screen lock possible."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija uključena, korisnik će se ponovo logirati automatski "
"ako je njegova sesija prekinuta padom X servera. Obratite pažnju da ovo "
"može otvoriti sigurnosnu rupu: ako koristite neki drugi program za "
"zaključavanje ekrana osim KDEovog integrisanog programa, ova opcija "
"omogućuje zaobilaženje zaključavanja ekrana šifrom."

